  triage:title "load_escalation_targets returns Result<EscalationTargets, ()>, discarding roster-store read failure context" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-1 (rust-best-practices-agent), PR #1408 @ 5ab184d75, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1408#issuecomment-5642703785. load_escalation_targets (herdr_escalation.rs:399-434) returns Result<EscalationTargets, ()>, discarding all error context at a real fallibility boundary (roster-store read failure). Recommend returning the underlying AtmError instead of (). fenix's ruling: herdr_escalation.rs is not BA.4-owned; BA.6 fold-in list." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
